OL,3,GNEWSACancer exercise group 'saved my
OL,4,Alife'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Lindsey Palmer, from Redcar was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with breast cancer in
OL,8,FJanuary, the last thing on her mind was
OL,9,Flifting weights.
OL,11,FHowever, the 55-year-old was referred
OL,12,Fto a cancer "prehabilitation" group run
OL,13,Fby the Middlesbrough Football Club
OL,14,FFoundation - a programme which uses
OL,15,Fexercise to prepare patients for their
OL,16,Ftreatment by improving physical
OL,17,Ffitness.
OL,19,FShe said the group has made her
OL,20,Fstronger, as well as improving her
OL,21,Fanxiety and mental health.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
